  "summary": "Most reported numbers reconcile: Table 6 date-precision counts sum to 43 projects and 19+10=29 day/month-dated projects; Table 8 listing counts sum to 700,579 and every share recomputes; Table 3/4 agreement is 33/34=97%; the text shares for Oslo, Akershus, Telemark, Nordland and Møre og Romsdal match Figure 4; the Figure 3 values (about 35% to about 44%) match the plotted series; and 18+26=44 projects. Three material numerical problems remain. (1) The text counts \"2 of the 34 unique articles (about 6 percent)\" as concerning an opening, but the two openings are projects and the same section codes five articles to them. (2) Footnote 3 says the Stord article was coded not relevant by both human coders, but Table 3 records one article coded relevant by the second coder, and the text identifies it as the Stord article. (3) Table 2 footnote c says Grettefoss Bridge opened on 3 November, while Figure 1 and the abstract count only two actual openings. One low-severity classification-rule ambiguity bears on Table 8 category shares and is reported as unresolved.",
